{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/1.gif?t=1744262486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dry Bones is a Platformer in which you control a Skeleton that is jumping, swinging and wallrunning to escape its dungeon! You will encounter many challanges like a minecard ride, or a flying broom course, but dont loose your head.... or should you? You will find mighty powerups like a doublejump or turnback of time in the form of alternative Heads to put on so stay alert, every level brings a load of new mechanics to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/swinging.gif?t=1744262486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Momentum based movement lets you pull of all sorts of tricks but the game is designed to be played for every skill level, there is much to explore in the 20+ Levels and much to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/wallrun.gif?t=1744262486\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603930?t=1744262486","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/5041e4fe41bef933db541ed448756bcd2fdaa38c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744262486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/b2b5c83301ae79653bc5e698a9df5eeab9dc7a24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744262486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/b2b5c83301ae79653bc5e698a9df5eeab9dc7a24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744262486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/1.gif?t=1744262486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dry Bones is a Platformer in which you control a Skeleton that is jumping, swinging and wallrunning to escape its dungeon! You will encounter many challanges like a minecard ride, or a flying broom course, but dont loose your head.... or should you? You will find mighty powerups like a doublejump or turnback of time in the form of alternative Heads to put on so stay alert, every level brings a load of new mechanics to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/swinging.gif?t=1744262486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Momentum based movement lets you pull of all sorts of tricks but the game is designed to be played for every skill level, there is much to explore in the 20+ Levels and much to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/wallrun.gif?t=1744262486\" /></p>","developers":["Leo Manfred Dietz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/031af23f0896e8ca90c2009634e08418366c846e/header.jpg?t=1744262486","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Dry Bones","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Wi